<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow prose">
    <p>We are working to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, level AA. The site is built to work with a keyboard and a screen reader, with a skip link, visible focus outlines, readable text sizes, high-contrast colors, large tap targets, and reduced-motion support.</p>
    <p>If something on this site is hard to use, or you'd like information in another format, tell us. <a href="/contact/?topic=website">Use the contact form</a> or call <a href="tel:{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>, and we will fix it or get you the information another way.</p>
  </div>
</section>
